@page "/"

<PageTitle>Day 4 Demo - Fluxor</PageTitle>

<h1>Day 4: Fluxor -- Actions and Reducers</h1>

<p class="lead">Welcome to the Day 4 demo project.</p>

<div class="card mt-3">
    <div class="card-body">
        <h5 class="card-title">What We'll Build</h5>
        <ul>
            <li>A <strong>Counter store</strong> with immutable state, actions, and reducers</li>
            <li><strong>Component wiring</strong> using FluxorComponent, IState, and IDispatcher</li>
            <li><strong>Redux DevTools</strong> integration to visualize actions and state changes</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="text-muted mt-2">The instructor will live-code the Fluxor store files during the demo.</p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="card mt-3">
    <div class="card-body">
        <h5 class="card-title">PRE-BUILT Setup</h5>
        <p>The following are already configured in this project:</p>
        <ul class="mb-0">
            <li><code>Fluxor.Blazor.Web</code> NuGet package installed</li>
            <li><code>Program.cs</code> -- AddFluxor with assembly scanning and Redux DevTools</li>
            <li><code>_Imports.razor</code> -- Fluxor using directives</li>
            <li><code>App.razor</code> -- StoreInitializer component</li>
            <li><code>Counter.razor</code> -- page UI (buttons, heading) with no Fluxor wiring</li>
        </ul>
    </div>
</div>
